sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Developer
    participant S as React SPA
    participant A as Express API
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    participant J as Jira Cloud
    U->>S: New future-to-do item (choose or create Story)
    S->>A: POST /screens/12/jira-ticket
    A->>A: authenticate, authorize (Admin, Dev)
    A->>D: Epic of screen 12?
    alt the screen has no Epic yet
        A->>J: POST /rest/api/3/issue (Epic, project TECHEA)
        J-->>A: 201 id, key
        A->>D: save Epic (one per screen, unique index)
    end
    opt newStory
        A->>J: POST /rest/api/3/issue (Story, parent = Epic)
        J-->>A: 201 id, key
        A->>D: save Story
    end
    A->>J: POST /rest/api/3/issue (Subtask, parent = Story)
    alt Jira answers
        J-->>A: 201 id, key
        A->>D: save Subtask (audited with the user as actor)
        A-->>S: 201 epic, story, subtask, created
    else Jira fails or times out
        A-->>S: 502 JIRA_PARTIAL_FAILURE, issues already created and storyId
        S->>U: retry with the same Story (no duplicates)
    end
